'''Empress' Report 3''' ('''女王の研究報告3''', ''Joō no Kenkyū Hōkoku 3'', "'''Queen's Research Report 3'''") is an [[Empress' Research]] map unlocked after clearing [[Empress' Report 2]]. Just like its predecessor, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Each stage has a different one-time reward, including an Aku [[Catfruit]] Seed in stage 4. Once completed, the player will unlock [[Empress' Report 4]], which drops another Aku Catfruit Seed. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

